# DOM Boundary

`@dndgem/dom` may depend on `@dndgem/core` and on browser/DOM APIs.

It must not depend on React or `@dndgem/react`.

DND-1.5 owns measurement, coordinate normalization, and ResizeObserver lifecycle in this package.

Still deferred:

- drag / resize product behaviour (DND-1.6)
- leaking raw HTMLElement types into core public contracts
